# ShipBob client rules

- Orders: `GET {SHIPBOB_API_BASE}/order` with header `shipbob_channel_id`
- Tracking: `GET https://api.shipbob.com/2026-07/shipments-tracking`
- Batch: `ShipmentIds=id1&ShipmentIds=id2` (repeated). Comma-separated → 400.
- Lookup by tracking number: `GET /2026-07/tracking?TrackingIds=…` (same repeated-param rule)
- Honour `X-Remaining-Calls` / `x-retry-after` on 429
- Map `history[]` into `tracking_events` with hash on shipment_id + occurred_at + status + substatus_code + description
- Location = `history[i].address` (city/state/postal/lat/lng); current location = newest history row
- See `examples/shipbob/` and skill `shipbob-tracking-api`
